I would not recommend Crabtree PM Limited to leaseholders or freeholders seeking competent and responsive property management services.

Extremely disappointing experience with Crabtree PM Limited. A straightforward lease enquiry regarding a pet licence under a medical needs clause turned into a 13-month cycle of delays, ignored emails, inconsistent responses, and shifting requirements that do not appear anywhere in the lease itself.

Unfortunately, this has not been an isolated issue. The management of the building itself has also been extremely poor, including:

* broken entrance gates and ongoing security concerns;
* repeated break-ins and bike thefts within the property;
* intercom systems left unresolved for extended periods;
* periods without hot water;
* extremely delayed responses to residents; and
* cleaning standards that have been unacceptable despite service charges continuing to be collected.

Only after repeated chasing and formal escalation was any meaningful response provided. The matter has now had to be referred to The Property Ombudsman.

As a leaseholder, I expected professionalism, transparency, and reasonable communication. Unfortunately, this process has been unnecessarily stressful and poorly handled from start to finish.
